@CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5055

@walletAddress = 0x742d35Cc6634C0532925a3b8D6AC6d08C85F3d1b
@testWalletAddress = 0x8ba1f109551bD432803012645Hac136c30BF
@transactionHash = 0x1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef
@transactionId = 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
@certificateId = 36bc8881-a786-432f-b5de-bca03f8193ba
@pageIndex = 0
@pageSize = 10

### 1. Get ETH Balance by Wallet Address - Sprawdzenie salda portfela
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthBalanceByWalletAddress/{{walletAddress}}
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get ETH Balance - Przykładowy portfel Ethereum
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthBalanceByWalletAddress/{{testWalletAddress}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get ETH Balance - Vitalik's wallet (przykład znanego adresu)
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthBalanceByWalletAddress/0xd8dA6BF26964aF9D7eEd9e03E53415D37aA96045
Accept: application/json

### 4. Register Certificate on Blockchain - Rejestracja certyfikatu
POST {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/registerCertificate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "{{transactionId}}",
  "certificateId": "{{certificateId}}",
  "certificateHash": "0x1a2b3c4d5e6f7890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890",
  "issuer": "Uniwersytet Techniczny Warszawa"
}

### 5. Register Certificate - Drugi przykład
POST {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/registerCertificate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "certificateId": "456e7890-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174111",
  "certificateHash": "0xabcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890ab",
  "issuer": "Tech Academy Poland"
}

### 6. Get Transaction Status by Hash - Status transakcji po hash
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthereumTransactionStatus/{{transactionHash}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get Transaction Status - Przykładowy hash transakcji
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthereumTransactionStatus/0xabcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890ab
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Transactions by Status - Transakcje potwierdzone
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthereumTransactionByStatus/Confirmed
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Transactions by Status - Transakcje wysłane
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthereumTransactionByStatus/Submitted
Accept: application/json

### 10. Get Transactions by Status - Transakcje nieudane
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthereumTransactionByStatus/Failed
Accept: application/json

### 11. Get Transactions by Status Filter - Filtr po wielu statusach
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthereumTransactionByStatusFilter?statuses=Confirmed&statuses=Submitted
Accept: application/json

### 12. Get Transactions by Status Filter - Tylko potwierdzone i nieudane
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthereumTransactionByStatusFilter?statuses=Confirmed&statuses=Failed
Accept: application/json

### 13. Count All Ethereum Transactions - Liczba wszystkich transakcji
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/countEthereumTransactions
Accept: application/json

### 14. Get Ethereum Transactions with Pagination - Transakcje z paginacją
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthereumTransactions?pageIndex={{pageIndex}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### 15. Get Ethereum Transactions - Druga strona
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthereumTransactions?pageIndex=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### 16. Get Ethereum Transactions - Bez parametrów paginacji
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthereumTransactions
Accept: application/json

### 17. Get All Ethereum Transactions - Wszystkie transakcje bez paginacji
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthereumAllTransactions
Accept: application/json

### 18. Get Transaction by ID - Transakcja po ID
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthereumTransactionById/{{transactionId}}
Accept: application/json

### 19. Get Transaction by Certificate ID - Transakcja po ID certyfikatu
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/getEthereumTransactionByCertificateId/{{certificateId}}
Accept: application/json

### 20. Delete Transaction by ID - Usunięcie transakcji
DELETE {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/deleteTransactionById/{{transactionId}}
Accept: application/json

### 21. Delete Transaction - Przykład usunięcia innej transakcji
DELETE {{CertiBlock.Services.Ethereum.Api_HostAddress}}/ethereum-service/Ethereum/deleteTransactionById/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
Accept: application/json

